  id: lore_village
  displayName: The Hymn of Saltmere
  description: Told by the village elder.
  kind: 3
  price: 0
  heal: 2
  damageBoost: 1.25
  boostBeats: 16
  teaches: 
  loreText: Before the walls, Saltmere had a song. Fishers sang it to keep the oars together, and the sea kept time with them. When the cliffs began to stir, it was the old cantors who answered, striking only when the tide struck.
